        // { monthly_revenue_usd, monthly_costs_usd, cash_on_hand_usd } — and whose mere presence
        // switches the whole pack into revision mode. One free-text answer therefore turned an
        // idea-stage launch into an "update" of a trading business, dropped its $37,500 funding
        // request, and sent undefined through the arithmetic until the Business Plan printed
        // "$NaN/month in revenue". The structured field stays owned by the intake fields built
        // for it.
        path: 'plan_detail.financials.historical',
        // Where the interview stores its prose answer is one question; what counts as having the
